schöner Abend wird Viele Grüße Lena","authoredText":"Liebe Anna, wie geht es dir? Am Samstag feiere ich in meiner neuen Wohnung. Sie ist größer als die alte. Ich wollte dich unbedingt einladen, weil du meine beste Freundin bist. Bring bitte Rohans Gitarre mit, wenn du kannst. Ich glaube, dass es ein schöner Abend wird. Viele Grüße, Lena","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Eine Einladung per E-Mail","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Nick, was hast du diese Woche gelernt?","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Weil ich Familie hatte, konnte ich nicht viel lernen.","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Aber ich weiß, dass der Genitiv nicht so schwer ist.","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Meine Woche war interessanter als deine!","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Ich habe die beste Note bekommen.","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-10-goethe-mini-1","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Toll!","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_010_L004","control"